{"id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-prim-theory.md","title":"Primitive Theory Carrier","display":"df-prim-theory — Primitive Theory Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-prim-theory","aliases":["67-df-prim-theory"],"display":"df-prim-theory — Primitive Theory Carrier","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-prim-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-prim-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prim-theory — Primitive Theory Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (fixed formal language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_L\\)</span> (theory predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T) \\leftrightarrow T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_L\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T) \\leftrightarrow T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_L\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file fixes the carrier type only: an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory is a set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentences, following <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d91538d9e6829fd1\" href=\"?note=d91538d9e6829fd1\" title=\"67-df-prim-theory\">67-df-prim-theory</a>.</li>\n<li>Deductive closure is the separate property defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6062469a25ee5f89\" href=\"?note=6062469a25ee5f89\" title=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (sentence set, see [[67-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headi